# Cursor AI Rules

You are assisting development on WUD (What's Up Docker?).
Always consult the master guidelines in [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md).

## Core Directives
- **Architecture**: Modular monorepo with `app/` (Backend Node.js/TypeScript/Express/LokiJS), `ui/` (Frontend Vue 3/Vuetify/TypeScript), `e2e/` (Cucumber tests), `ui-e2e/` (Playwright tests), and `website/` (Docusaurus).
- **TypeScript**: Strict typing; do not use `any`. Validate configurations using Joi schemas.
- **Testing**: Unit tests are required for all changes (`npm test` in `app/`, `npm run test:unit` in `ui/`).
- **Linting**: Ensure code passes ESLint and Prettier (`npm run lint` / `npm run lint:fix`).
- **Documentation**: Update documentation in `website/docs/` when adding features or configurations. Ensure `website` builds (`npm run build`).
- **Changelog**: Add unreleased release notes to `website/docs/changelog/next.md`.
- **Integrity**: Never break backward compatibility of existing environment variables or configuration keys.
